  "description": "Details of Condition 4 (CEMP) pursuant to planning permission ref: 23/AP/2349 granted on 29/02/2024 for: (Improvements to the listed building to bring it up to standard for continued use as Offices and Businesses includes the following:   \r-Replacement of existing internal stairs with new and adjustments to the stair core on the fourth floor. \r-Replacement of lift with new to extend to the fourth floor. \r-Replacement of the doors to the rear elevation and removal of existing modern window and wall section on first floor for new door to fire escape stair.\r-First floor glass roof to be removed and replaced with a solid roof.\r-Changes to the approved rear fire escape stair and landings including extension to the First floor.\r-Replacement of pavement lights.\r-First-floor terrace plant enclosure extended to accommodate new plant.\r-Adjustments to terraces on the first floor and roof.\r-Replacement of the roof access dormer, new skylights and warm roof build-up with like for like finish. Making good of the existing external lighting and addition of external lighting to entrance, fire escape and terraces).\r",
